                    "text": "Who are you?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "643600202",
                    "speaker": "Behnam",
                    "text": "The Akademiya sent me here to take charge of overseeing and maintaining the fortification work at the desert's edge. I usually stay in the pitstop."
                },
                {
                    "id": "643600203",
                    "speaker": "Behnam",
                    "text": "The rainforest is of utmost importance to the lives of Sumeru's people. We can't allow the desert to erode it."
                },
                {
                    "id": "643600204",
                    "speaker": "Behnam",
                    "text": "Wall of Samiel is our key defense against the sandstorm. We must practice thorough and effective defense with it."
                }
            ]
        },
